41
00:01:13.790 --> 00:01:14.800 line:15%
that he would be there.

42
00:01:14.800 --> 00:01:15.947 line:15%
'Cause you know, sometimes the doctor's like,

43
00:01:15.947 --> 00:01:18.430 line:15%
"And if I'm busy, Chuck will show up."

44
00:01:18.430 --> 00:01:19.470 line:15%
You know?
(Drew laughs)

45
00:01:19.470 --> 00:01:21.440 line:15%
And we were like, "We don't want Chuck. We don't know Chuck.

46
00:01:21.440 --> 00:01:22.770 line:15%
We'd like to just have you do it,

47
00:01:22.770 --> 00:01:25.840 line:15%
so can you promise that you're in town this month or so,

48
00:01:25.840 --> 00:01:27.100
