49
00:01:27.100 --> 00:01:29.360
And the doctor's like, "Definitely.

50
00:01:29.360 --> 00:01:30.510
I will definitely be there."

51
00:01:30.510 --> 00:01:33.310
And then Leslie's water broke,

52
00:01:33.310 --> 00:01:35.470
