53
00:01:35.470 --> 00:01:39.150
and the doctor said, "No, that's not your water breaking."

54
00:01:39.150 --> 00:01:43.310
And then three hours later, she's in full labor.

55
00:01:43.310 --> 00:01:45.680
And then we call the office and go, "Okay, it's time."

56
00:01:45.680 --> 00:01:47.350
And they went, "Oh, the doctor just went

57
00:01:47.350 --> 00:01:49.068
