68
00:02:14.940 --> 00:02:17.260
And as it was happening, it was such a nightmare,

69
00:02:17.260 --> 00:02:20.410
I just thought, one day, I just have to put this in a movie

70
00:02:20.410 --> 00:02:22.790 line:15%
