85
00:02:51.900 --> 00:02:52.733 line:15%
Yes, I agree.

86
00:02:52.733 --> 00:02:54.540 line:15%
I mean, it was so honest and so frank,

87
00:02:54.540 --> 00:02:56.340 line:15%
